{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ae7cf31e-82d9-84a9-bf96-50c97f36561b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T10:44:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I am calling about old records. Genealogy records, from the 1930s. Do you have those there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me make sure I understand. You're looking for records from the nineteen-thirties. Would that be births, marriages, or deaths?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Births, and one marriage also. It is for my husband's family. They were in Newport at that time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Yes, our office keeps vital records for events that happened in Newport, and older ones can usually be requested for genealogy. I'd need the names and the approximate year for each one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the names. Um, my husband is at work right now. He normally handles this kind of call, but I am doing it today. So I want to be sure I understand everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time. I'll go slowly. For records that old, you would fill out a request form, and there's a fee. The form says what you need to include."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The form, I can get it online, or I have to come there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one. You can pick one up here at the counter, or find it on the city website under the City Clerk page. You can also mail it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:43:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And how long it takes? The turnaround, I think you say. From when I send until I receive the copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you bring it in, it's often handled quickly, sometimes the same day if the record is easy to find. By mail it's longer, usually a week or two. Older books can take extra searching, so the marriage might be slower."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the mail is one or two weeks, and in person can be the same day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. In person can be same day, mail a week or two, and the older ones might take a little more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, perfect. Then I will tell my husband tonight, and we will decide. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
